<title>ITALY: Work on lira ERM re-entry going well - Ciampi.</title>
<headline>Work on lira ERM re-entry going well - Ciampi.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union monetary committee has started work assessing the return of the lira to the European exchange rate mechanism (ERM), Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The work is going well,&quot; Ciampi told reporters.  </p>
<p>A Treasury spokesman later said Ciampi was referring to the Italy's own euro committee and not the European Union monetary committee.</p>
<p>The government has said the lira will go back into the ERM before the end of the year. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
